---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE, withBase } from '../lib/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer / NFA"
  description="Euro Desk FX disclaimer: educational content only. This is not financial advice. Trading involves risk of loss."
  canonicalPath="/disclaimer/"
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 sm:py-20">
    <p class="label-micro">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="headline-md mt-3" style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.25rem);">Disclaimer / NFA</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium text-charcoal">Not financial advice · Risk note</p>

    <div class="prose-blog mt-10">
      <p>
        All content from <strong>{SITE.name}</strong> — including this website, the Telegram channel,
        posts on X, and related materials — is shared
        <strong>for education and information only</strong>.
      </p>
      <h2>This is not financial advice</h2>
      <p>
        Nothing published here is financial, investment, tax, or trading advice. Euro Desk FX is not a
        regulated advisor. Personal goals, risk limits, and account size are unknown — so no signal or
        article can replace your own judgment.
      </p>
      <h2>Risk of loss</h2>
      <p>
        Forex and related products carry a high risk of losing capital. Leveraged products can magnify
        losses. Past results do not predict future results.
      </p>
      <h2>Signals and ideas</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Signals and charts are opinions and study material — not orders to execute.</li>
        <li>There is no guarantee of profit, win rate, or outcome.</li>
        <li>There is no VIP service, managed copy-trading, or portfolio management.</li>
        <li>You check spreads, costs, hours, and broker rules yourself.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Your responsibility</h2>
      <p>
        By using these channels, you accept that trading decisions are yours alone. {SITE.name} and its
        operators are not liable for losses or damages from use of the shared information.
      </p>
      <h2>Official links</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Telegram: <a href={SITE.telegram} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{SITE.telegram}</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          X: <a href={SITE.x} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{SITE.x}</a>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <blockquote>
        Only trade with capital you can afford to lose. If you need personal advice, speak with a
        licensed professional in your jurisdiction.
      </blockquote>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-12 font-legal text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-muted-soft">
      Educational content only. This is not financial advice. Trading involves risk of loss.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-8">
      <a href={withBase('/')} class="link-arrow">← Back home</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
